OL,3,GNEWSACancer trial hopes to reduce risks
OL,4,Afor rare condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers are hoping a new clinical
OL,7,Ftrial could delay or reduce the risk of
OL,8,Fcancer for people with a rare
OL,9,Fcondition.
OL,11,FLi-Fraumeni syndrome (LFS) can increase
OL,12,Fan individuals likelihood of developing
OL,13,Fcancer during their lifetime by about
OL,14,F90%.
OL,16,FIt is known to affect about 700 people
OL,17,Fin the UK - but scientists believe as
OL,18,Fmany as one in 20,000 may have it.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
