OL,3,GNEWSACancer trial hopes to reduce risks
OL,4,Afor rare condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team behind the trial at the
OL,7,FUniversity of Oxford hope to gain a
OL,8,Fbetter understanding of the condition
OL,9,Fand are aiming to create a vaccine to
OL,10,Fprotect people from cancer.
